<h1><span>Questions I Have While Reading Through</span></h1>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-XXXX is a entity that closely resembles a domesticated dog with the height of approximately 0.3 meters. It has dark solid grey fur all around it’s body, and has no tail. Weirdly enough, it has no body parts except for limbs and the torso, and head. The bottom of its feet where you would usually find paws, is just more fur. It’s crouch where you would find the anus and genitals, has nothing. It’s just more fur.</p>
<p>It also has a Elizabethan collar on its head, that covers all of its face. If somebody attempts to look at it, a strange force stops them from doing so. No matter how hard they try, and no matter how much force pushing to see its face, the invisible wall simply will not go away.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This is just a recap of the Elevator Pitch.</p>
