<h1><span>final notes</span></h1>
<p>Okay, your central narrative is literally just describing the SCP. I love the idea, but there isn't a story. I don't think the core anomaly can survive without something to hold it up. Think of things you could do with this SCP. What stories could you tell? You could take this in a heartwarming direction or a really sad one. Just kinda depends on what you plan on doing.</p>
<p>Good luck!</p>
